---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const whatsapp = 'https://wa.me/6281389896052?text=Halo%20Link%20Manekin%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20kebutuhan%20manekin.';
---

<Layout
  title="Kontak Link Manekin Indonesia"
  description="Hubungi Link Manekin Indonesia melalui WhatsApp, Instagram, TikTok, Tokopedia, atau Shopee untuk konsultasi manekin retail, sports, atelier, dan custom finishing."
>
  <section class="section-shell page-intro contact-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">CONTACT / LINK MANEKIN INDONESIA</p>
    <h1>
      Mulai dari kebutuhan.
      <br />
      <em>Kami bantu bentuk pilihannya.</em>
    </h1>
    <div class="intro-bottom">
      <p>
        Untuk katalog, ukuran, custom finishing, ketersediaan, atau kebutuhan
        proyek B2B, hubungi kanal resmi di bawah ini.
      </p>
      <a class="button button-dark" href={whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Chat WhatsApp ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell contact-grid" aria-label="Kanal kontak Link Manekin">
    <a class="contact-card contact-card-primary" href={whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="eyebrow">FASTEST RESPONSE</span>
      <h2>WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>0813-8989-6052</p>
      <span class="contact-card-link">Mulai konsultasi ↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="contact-card" href="https://www.instagram.com/linkmanekin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="eyebrow">INSTAGRAM</span>
      <h2>@linkmanekin</h2>
      <p>Lihat update visual, produk, dan aktivitas terbaru.</p>
      <span class="contact-card-link">Buka Instagram ↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="contact-card" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@linkmanekinindonesia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="eyebrow">TIKTOK</span>
      <h2>@linkmanekinindonesia</h2>
      <p>Video produk, detail bentuk, dan konten display.</p>
      <span class="contact-card-link">Buka TikTok ↗</span>
    </a>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE STUDIO</span>
      <h2>Kota Tangerang</h2>
      <p>Banten, Indonesia. Kunjungan dengan janji temu melalui WhatsApp.</p>
      <a class="contact-card-link" href={whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buat janji ↗</a>
    </div>

    <a class="contact-card" href="https://www.tokopedia.com/find/pt-link-manekin-indonesia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="eyebrow">MARKETPLACE</span>
      <h2>Tokopedia</h2>
      <p>Cari produk PT Link Manekin Indonesia di Tokopedia.</p>
      <span class="contact-card-link">Buka Tokopedia ↗</span>
    </a>

    <a class="contact-card" href="https://shopee.co.id/search?keyword=pt%20link%20manekin%20indonesia" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span class="eyebrow">MARKETPLACE</span>
      <h2>Shopee</h2>
      <p>Cari produk PT Link Manekin Indonesia di Shopee.</p>
      <span class="contact-card-link">Buka Shopee ↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell contact-brief" aria-labelledby="contact-brief-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU MESSAGE</p>
      <h2 id="contact-brief-title">Agar konsultasi lebih cepat.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol>
      <li><span>01</span><p>Sebutkan jenis manekin atau kategori produk yang dicari.</p></li>
      <li><span>02</span><p>Cantumkan jumlah unit dan kota pengiriman.</p></li>
      <li><span>03</span><p>Jika custom, kirim referensi warna, logo, atau kebutuhan finishing.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</Layout>
